1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:02,794
Five things you must do in Vatican City.

2
00:00:04,700 --> 00:00:08,851
Do book your museum ticket online, on the official site only. Look-alike sites charge far more.

3
00:00:09,901 --> 00:00:18,553
Do climb the dome of Saint Peter's. It's five hundred fifty one steps, or three hundred twenty after the elevator.

4
00:00:19,603 --> 00:00:25,148
Do get a free ticket for the Wednesday papal audience. It costs nothing, but you must ask ahead.

5
00:00:26,198 --> 00:00:32,019
Do send a postcard from the Vatican post office. Drop it in the yellow mailbox, with Vatican stamps only.

6
00:00:33,069 --> 00:00:38,795
And do visit the tomb of Saint Peter, under the basilica. Only about two hundred fifty people can go each day.
